# OmniBridge routes for the shared edge Caddy (P-004, ADR-015). The edge project imports every
# app's file with `import sites/*.caddy` and owns TLS, global options and the `waf` snippet
# (Coraza + CRS). OmniBridge changes only this file. First used on a server in M22.
#
# Upstreams are the OmniBridge network aliases on ob_edge (compose.yaml), never bare service
# names, so they cannot collide with another app's containers on the same host.

omnibridge.co.uk, www.omnibridge.co.uk {
	import waf
	reverse_proxy omnibridge-site:8080
}

app.omnibridge.co.uk {
	import waf
	reverse_proxy omnibridge-web:8080
}
